msgid "For sufficiently large $n$, the functions are in increasing order of growth:"
msgstr "对于足够大的 $n$，这些函数按增长速度从慢到快排列为："

msgid "\\log n < n < n \\log n < n^2 < n^3 < 2^n."
msgstr ""

msgid "An $O(\\log n)$ algorithm scales much better than an $O(n)$ algorithm, which scales much better than an $O(n^2)$ algorithm, and an $O(2^n)$ algorithm quickly becomes impractical, even for inputs of a few dozen elements."
msgstr "$O(\\log n)$ 算法的可扩展性远好于 $O(n)$ 算法，而 $O(n)$ 算法又远好于 $O(n^2)$ 算法；$O(2^n)$ 算法则很快会变得不切实际，即使输入只有几十个元素。"

msgid "In the next section, we will find the Big-O bound of several pieces of code, including loops and recursive functions."
msgstr "在下一节中，我们会求出几段代码的 Big-O 上界，包括循环和递归函数。"

